# Force LF in the repository and in every working tree, regardless of core.autocrlf.
# Rationale: the vendored recon.sh/setup.sh are hashed byte-for-byte by
# recon-engine/scripts/recon_sync.py against recon-script.lock, and are executed by
# bash (WSL/Git Bash) — CRLF checkouts broke both the freshness check and the scripts
# themselves. Keep executable/data formats LF; text prose can stay auto.
*.sh          text eol=lf
*.py          text eol=lf
*.lock        text eol=lf
*.json        text eol=lf
*.jsonl       text eol=lf
*.csv         text eol=lf
*.env.example text eol=lf
*.md          text eol=lf
